Number of standard axles in msa is given by, [latex]
\begin{aligned}
N_{s} &=\frac{365 A\left[(1+r)^{n}-1\right]}{r \times 10^{6}}+F \\
&=\frac{365 \times 2723 \times\left[\left(1+\frac{5}{100}\right)^{10}-1\right]}{\frac{5}{100} \times 10^{6}} \times 2.4 \\
&=30 \mathrm{msa}
\end{aligned}[/latex] Now, for 5 % CBR value, the total thickness of the pavement for 30 msa is given as 670 mm.
